    ]
}

{
  "recap": "The segment summarized VR experience optimization, which is a form of psychophysiological optimization aimed at addressing cybersickness. We also introduced resource optimization as the second key type of optimization for XR. Students can use the six provided references to learn more before the next lecture, which will focus on resource optimization.",
